<title>POLAND: NEW KREDYT BANK SHARES TO TRADE ON FEB 28.</title>
<headline>NEW KREDYT BANK SHARES TO TRADE ON FEB 28.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of the Warsaw bourse approved for trade on the exchange 2.28 million shares of Kredyt Bank boosting the number of traded Kredyt Bank shares to 13.15 million, Kredyt Bank said in a Monday statement.</p>
<p>The shares will start trade on February 28.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
